Archons aren't nasties.

The code in wizard.c (function nasty())
picks a random nasty and tries to generate it;
if that fails (because it is genocided), a random
monster is generated instead. (This is somewhat
simplified, but it's the important part.)

Because of that, you need to have genocided at
least one nasty for summon nasties to summon
Archons.

Of course, genociding more nasties makes choosing
a genocided nasty more likely; and genociding more
monsters in general will mean there are fewer random
monsters to choose from.

